---
import AiStackExperience from '../explain/AiStackExperience.astro';

// The AI Stack Feature — homepage wrapper.
//
// The complete approved AI Stack experience (artwork, every story state,
// copy, timing, gating, reduced-motion and keyboard behaviour, and the
// decoded-label and finale states) now lives in one place —
// src/components/explain/AiStackExperience.astro — so the homepage Feature
// surface and the permanent Explore route (/explore/ai-stack/) render the
// same component rather than two copies of the same story. This file is
// deliberately left with nothing of its own: the experience component
// already carries its own width cap and right-column alignment
// (--ais-w, margin-left: auto), which is exactly the "homepage-specific
// sizing" this wrapper would otherwise need to supply, so there is nothing
// left to add here without duplicating what the shared component already
// does.
//
// PROTOTYPE. Not registered in src/features/registry.ts, so it has no
// permanent route, no Explore card, no share image, no structured data and
// no sitemap entry. The homepage still renders whatever the registry names
// (currently Zero Trust). The only place this appears is the dev-only
// preview route, /preview/ai-stack/.
---

<AiStackExperience />
